		"jurisdiction_code": "SG",
		"change_summary": "1 January 2026: the CPF Board contribution tables raise senior workers above 55–60 to 34% and above 60–65 to 25% with the SGD 8,000 Ordinary Wage ceiling (CPF Act 1953 First Schedule), and the security-sector PWM floors take their 2026 step. Shared Parental Leave is keyed to the child’s birth or Formal Intent to Adopt date, so its 10 weeks for children from 1 April 2026 need no version of their own.",
